            PA ≫ ρ.gA = (θ₀ B'' s).1 →
              PA ≫ ρ.φ' ≫ ρ.gb = (θ B'' (fun i => MvFormalGroup.nilEval m (σ i) s)).1) :
    ∃ τ : Series (B ⧸ Ideal.span {algebraMap 𝒪 B π}),
